@startuml
actor Caller
participant "Signing API" as API
participant "Application Service" as App
participant "Jsign Adapter" as Jsign
participant "RFC 3161 TSA" as TSA

Caller -> API: POST fileName + scriptContent
API -> App: sign(request)
App -> App: validate name, size, unsigned input
App -> Jsign: sign(unique temporary .ps1)
Jsign -> TSA: timestamp digest (when enabled)
TSA --> Jsign: validated timestamp token
Jsign --> App: signed script metadata
App -> App: read result and delete temporary file
App --> API: signed content
API --> Caller: 200 + correlation ID
@enduml
